# .stignore — patterns Syncthing should NOT synchronize within ~/.true-love/.
#
# Copy this file to ~/.true-love/.stignore on every device that runs Syncthing.
# Syncthing reads it on every scan; no restart needed for changes to take effect.

# Per-device identity — each machine has its own. If this synced, every
# device would suddenly have every other device's id.
device.id

# Atomic-write tmp files (presence heartbeats use this pattern). Already
# transient on the local filesystem; no value in syncing the half-written
# states.
*.tmp

# Sync-conflict files — Syncthing creates these when both ends edit the
# same file at the same time. Don't re-sync them; let Yu resolve manually.
*.sync-conflict-*
